  "body": "I got error like this, anyone can help?\r\n\r\n`Uncaught (in promise) DOMException: Origin is not allowed to access any service. Tip: Add the service UUID to 'optionalServices' in requestDevice() options.`\r\n\r\nMy code like this\r\n```\r\n/* eslint-disable */\r\n      const device = await window.navigator.bluetooth.requestDevice({\r\n        acceptAllDevices: true,\r\n        optionalService: ['000018f0-0000-1000-8000-00805f9b34fb']\r\n      })\r\n      console.log('DEVICE INFO: ', device.name);\r\n      const server = await device.gatt.connect();\r\n      console.log('server: ', server);\r\n      const service = await server.getPrimaryService('000018f0-0000-1000-8000-00805f9b34fb');\r\n      console.log('service: ', service);\r\n      const characteristic = await service.getCharacteristic(\"00002af1-0000-1000-8000-00805f9b34fb\");\r\n      console.log('service: ', service);\r\n```",
